  "live_records": {
    "q-68333": {
      "dom_id": "step-q68333",
      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "$\\frac{{3}^{2}}{{3}^{-3}}=$",
      "worked_solution": "First, we write the fraction as a division:\n\n$$\n\\frac{{3}^{2}}{{3}^{-3}}={3}^{2}÷{3}^{-3}\n$$\n\nNow, to divide powers of the same base, we simply subtract the exponents:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{3}^{2}÷{3}^{-3} & ={3}^{2-(-3)} \\\\  & ={3}^{2+3} \\\\  & ={3}^{5}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
