      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "${(\\frac{1}{2})}^{5}÷{(\\frac{1}{2})}^{2}=$",
      "worked_solution": "To divide powers of the same base, we simply subtract the exponents:\n\n$$\n{(\\frac{1}{2})}^{5}÷{(\\frac{1}{2})}^{2}={(\\frac{1}{2})}^{5-2}={(\\frac{1}{2})}^{3}\n$$",
