      "problem": "$(-1.8)^{9}÷(-1.8)^{3}=$",
      "worked_solution": "To divide powers of the same base, we simply subtract the exponents:\n\n$$\n(-1.8)^{9}÷(-1.8)^{3}=(-1.8)^{9-3}=(-1.8)^{6}\n$$",
