    "q-100343": {
      "dom_id": "step-q100343",
      "name": "Question 6",
      "problem": "$\\frac{{0.01}^{6}}{{0.01}^{8}}=$",
      "worked_solution": "First, we write the fraction as a division:\n\n$$\n\\frac{{0.01}^{6}}{{0.01}^{8}}={0.01}^{6}÷{0.01}^{8}\n$$\n\nTo divide powers of the same base, we simply subtract the exponents:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{0.01}^{6}÷{0.01}^{8} & ={0.01}^{6-8} \\\\  & ={0.01}^{-2}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
